[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0036","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0039","title":"AltaVista Search Intranet 目录遍历漏洞","description":"AltaVista Search Intranet 2.0 b/2.3 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞。其 query.cgi CGI 程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，远程攻击者可通过在请求中插入 ../（点点斜杠）序列绕过目录限制，读取 Web 根目录之外的任意文件，如系统配置文件或敏感数据。该漏洞利用难度较低，无需认证即可触发，影响运行 AltaVista Search Intranet 2.0 b/2.3 的服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0039"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.507","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的现代搜索引擎（如 Apache Solr 或 Elasticsearch），并停止使用 AltaVista Search Intranet。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层配置访问控制，禁止外部访问 query.cgi 脚本，或移除该 CGI 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/15","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/896","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0039","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0039.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p9q-hpm8-jw92/GHSA-5p9q-hpm8-jw92.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/altavista_search.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0039.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000974.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0010","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0009","title":"Nortel Networks Optivity NETarchitect 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Nortel Networks Optivity NETarchitect 2.0 中的 bna_pass 程序在调用系统 rm 命令时依赖 PATH 环境变量来定位可执行文件，未使用绝对路径，构成安全漏洞。本地攻击者可通过修改 PATH 环境变量，将恶意程序替换为 rm 并在 bna_pass 执行时被调用，从而以 bna_pass 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Optivity NETarchitect 2.0 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0009"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48.877","remediation":"将 bna_pass 程序中对 rm 的调用改为使用绝对路径 /bin/rm，或在执行 system() 前将 PATH 环境变量重置为安全值（如 /bin:/usr/bin），避免继承用户的 PATH 环境变量。同时设置程序以最小权限运行，禁止 SUID 提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/907","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19704","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0009","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0009.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9da4ebcefe304654f22bdf6c578568005410bc6c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3ch7-w6x4-f69f/GHSA-3ch7-w6x4-f69f.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0009.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000973.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/9d0315205d43d95e2c2bb89a3750b8aa22a01721/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0010.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0010.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0008","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0007","title":"Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 内部代理端口未授权访问导致远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 防病毒软件内置的代理服务器组件存在访问控制缺陷，该代理端口未对远程连接进行任何身份验证或来源限制，导致未经认证的远程攻击者可直接向代理端口发送恶意请求，耗尽系统资源或造成代理服务崩溃，从而引发拒绝服务（DoS）。攻击者无需任何权限，仅通过网络即可发起攻击，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。受影响的 Trend Micro PC-Cillin 6.0 版本用户需升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0007"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-29T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48.623","remediation":"升级到 Trend Micro PC-Cillin 7.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对内部代理端口（默认 1080/tcp）的外部访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接；同时在软件设置中为代理组件添加访问认证或绑定到本地回环地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1740","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4491","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0007","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0007.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0007.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-2000-0007.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mh88-2q4r-3gq4/GHSA-mh88-2q4r-3gq4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0007.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0037","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0041","title":"Apple MacOS 9 ICMP 放大攻击漏洞","description":"Mac OS 9 系统在处理畸形 ICMP 数据包时存在放大攻击漏洞。远程攻击者向目标 Mac 系统发送少量伪造数据包，系统会生成大量 ICMP 响应报文，导致流量被放大，可被利用于 DDoS 分布式拒绝服务攻击中放大攻击流量。该漏洞影响 Mac OS 9 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0041"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.757","remediation":"立即升级到受支持的 macOS 版本（如 macOS 10.15 及以上），MacOS 9 已停止支持且无安全补丁。如无法升级，可在网络边界防火墙或路由器上限制入站 ICMP 数据包速率，并过滤源地址为非本网的 ICMP 请求，防止系统被用作 DDoS 放大反射点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/890","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0041.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0041","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0041.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0041.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xvrg-83h8-x5v4/GHSA-xvrg-83h8-x5v4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0041.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_100_200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000971.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f6072b43-42b8-498b-8bf1-55941fa1ac81.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0035","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0037","title":"Majordomo 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Majordomo 是一款邮件列表管理软件，其 wrapper 组件存在本地权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 wrapper 传递 `-C` 参数指定任意配置文件，从而以 Majordomo 运行权限执行恶意操作，获取非授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Majordomo 1.94.4 及 1.94.5 版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0037"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-12-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.263","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Majordomo 2.x 或更高版本（1.94.4/1.94.5 已不再维护），该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。使用 Red Hat Linux 的系统请安装 RHSA-2000-005 安全更新。如无法升级，可移除 wrapper 程序的 setuid 权限（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/wrapper`），并将 wrapper 文件权限设为仅 root 可执行（`chmod 700 /usr/bin/wrapper`），同时确保 Majordomo 配置目录仅对邮件管理员可写。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780294009285&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/903","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19700","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0037.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0037","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0037.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0037.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-58v6-mw8v-65hc/GHSA-58v6-mw8v-65hc.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0037.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0032","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0035","title":"Great Circle Associates Majordomo resend 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Majordomo 1.94.4 及更早版本的 resend 命令存在 shell 元字符注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该命令传递包含特殊字符的参数，利用 shell 元字符注入以 Majordomo 进程权限执行任意命令。此漏洞影响 Great Circle Associates 开发的邮件列表管理软件 Majordomo，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击前提是攻击者拥有目标系统的本地 shell 访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0035"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-12-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.027","remediation":"立即升级 Majordomo 至 2.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 resend 命令中 shell 元字符过滤不严的问题。如无法升级，可手动编辑 Majordomo 源码中的 resend 脚本，对用户输入中的 `;`、`|`、`` ` ``、`$` 等 shell 特殊字符进行转义过滤，并限制 resend 命令仅允许授权用户通过 wrapper 调用，避免本地普通用户直接执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94780294009285&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/902","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19698","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0035","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0035.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0035.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4wrx-2682-w227/GHSA-4wrx-2682-w227.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/902/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0035.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.c