 POP3 Server 1.1 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即迁移至仍在活跃维护的 POP3 服务软件（如 Dovecot 或 Cyrus），并在防火墙策略中限制对 110/TCP 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任客户端连接。同时可在应用层限制用户名输入长度以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94633851427858&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94647711311057&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/3765.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/894"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0025","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0027","title":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 竞争条件漏洞","description":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1（NetStation）存在本地竞争条件漏洞，通过符号链接攻击（symlink attack）实现权限提升。本地攻击者可利用 NetStation 在处理临时文件时存在的竞态条件，诱导程序访问恶意构造的符号链接文件，从而以更高权限执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 版本，攻击复杂度较高，需要本地系统访问权限，一旦成功利用可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0027"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-27","updated":"1999-12-27","remediation":"IBM Network Station Manager 2.0 R1 已停止维护，官方不再提供补丁。建议升级至不受影响的版本（如 3.0 及以上），或将管理界面限制在受信任内网，通过防火墙/ACL 仅允许管理 IP 访问 TCP 端口 2301，并禁用不必要的远程管理功能以降低竞争条件被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19697","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0027.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0027","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0027.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0027.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/96d4f89872236c04a1a34287b2e6b358501d08ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qv8j-42h3-c36j/GHSA-qv8j-42h3-c36j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0027.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/c9b68d7e9fee580d97403fe7a317626fdb0fba2c/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0011","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0010","title":"Tony Greenwood WebWho+ 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Tony Greenwood WebWho+ 1.1 中的 whois.cgi 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 TLD 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）执行任意系统命令，从而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，且已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码，危害严重。受影响版本为 WebWho+ 1.1，建议升级或移除该 CGI 脚本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0010"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:49.007","remediation":"立即移除或禁用 WebWho+ 的 whois.cgi 脚本，改用系统自带的 whois 命令行工具替代。如需继续使用，须在 CGI 脚本中对 TLD 参数做严格白名单过滤（仅允许字母、数字和连字符），并禁止将用户输入直接传递给 system() 或 popen() 函数，避免 shell 元字符注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0010","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19691","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0010.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b8712ba896f892b31b495bb919cac52eac29a85/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0010.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f